  "quest_dialogue": [
    {
      "quest_id": "1013",
      "quest_name": "Rain's Maple Quiz 1",
      "npc_role": "start",
      "start_npc_id": "19",
      "complete_npc_id": "19",
      "section": "On accept",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Hello! How're you liking Maple World so far? Let me give you a brief rundown of the place, and then I'll give you a quiz. If you answer my questions correctly, I'll give you something handy. Interested?"
        }
      ],
      "branches": [
        {
          "key": "yes",
          "label": "If you accept",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Hehe! Let me warn you, don't underestimate my quiz. There's a lot to learn, so pay attention!"
            },
            {
              "text": "How is your adventure on Maple Island so far? You can go left with the left arrow key and right with the right arrow key, right? Do you also know that if you press the down arrow key, you can crouch, and then jump while crouching, to leap down to a lower platform? If you press the up arrow key in front of a portal, you can enter it, and if you press the up arrow key in front of a ladder or rope, you can climb or hang from it.",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "How is your adventure on Maple Island so far? You can go left with the "
                },
                {
                  "text": "left arrow key",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": " and right with the "
                },
                {
                  "text": "right arrow key",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": ", right? Do you also know that if you press the "
                },
                {
                  "text": "down arrow key",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": ", you can crouch, and then jump while crouching, to leap down to a lower platform? If you press the "
                },
                {
                  "text": "up arrow key",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": " in front of a portal, you can enter it, and if you press the "
                },
                {
                  "text": "up arrow key",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": " in front of a ladder or rope, you can climb or hang from it."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "You can also use the Key Config on the bottom right of your screen to recalibrate the buttons to your liking. Hmm. I think this explanation might have gotten a little too complicated. Don't worry, you'll get the hang of it as you spend more time here and get used to things.",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "You can also use the "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Key Config",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                {
                  "text": " on the bottom right of your screen to recalibrate the buttons to your liking. Hmm. I think this explanation might have gotten a little too complicated. Don't worry, you'll get the hang of it as you spend more time here and get used to things."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "But what you haven't experienced yet is Job Advancement. To become a more powerful traveler, you need a job! To get one, you'll first have to leave this place, Maple Island, and head to Victoria Island. \nYou need to be at least at level 10 to become a Warrior, Bowman, Magician or Thief. Each job has its pros and cons, so choose carefully.",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "But what you haven't experienced yet is Job Advancement. To become a more powerful traveler, you need a job! To get one, you'll first have to leave this place, Maple Island, and head to Victoria Island. \nYou need to be at least at level "
                },
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": " to become a "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Warrior, Bowman, Magician",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": " or "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Thief",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Each job has its pros and cons, so choose carefully."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "I didn't tell you EVERYTHING you need to know for the quiz, so make sure to focus. Ready for the questions?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "no",
          "label": "If you decline",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Hmm, you could learn a lot through my quiz. I think you should try it!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "quiz": null
    },
    {
