          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "The left arrow key is for moving left. Do you remember which key you need to press in front of a ladder or rope?"
            },
            {
              "text": "No, no. The right arrow is the key for moving right. Think carefully!"
            },
            {
              "text": "Huh? The down arrow key is used to crouch or move to a lower platform. So, it can't be the down arrow key, right?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": null,
          "label": "When you answer correctly",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "That's right! If you press the up arrow key in front of a ladder or rope, you can hang from it!",
